# 5-transistor OTA (one stage): NMOS input pair, PMOS mirror load, NMOS tail mirrored from IREF.
# Output at the mirror's output branch; VINN drives the output-side input device (inverting).
NMOS M1a d1 VINP tail VSS
NMOS M1b VOUT VINN tail VSS
PMOS M3a d1 d1 VDD VDD
PMOS M3b VOUT d1 VDD VDD
NMOS M5 tail IREF VSS VSS
NMOS M6 IREF IREF VSS VSS
